# 与 .gitignore 保持**超集**关系（非逐行同步）：凡「不该进版本库」的（机密 /
# 本地文件）同样不该进构建上下文；此外还排除**构建产物与 VCS 元数据**——
# .git、DB/日志、internal/webui/static（镜像内由 Dockerfile 从 fresh 前端构建
# 重新生成）。构建上下文 = 仓库根（见 deploy/docker-compose.yml: context: ..）。

# --- VCS metadata: MUST stay excluded from the build context ---
.git

# --- Secrets / local env ---
.env
deploy/.env
deploy/docker-compose.override.yml

# --- Dependencies ---
**/node_modules

# --- Build artifacts (rebuilt inside the image) ---
bin/
dist/
frontend/dist
internal/webui/static
*.exe

# --- Databases ---
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# --- Logs & captures ---
*.log
capture-raw

# --- Personal notes: kept locally, never uploaded. ---
private/

# --- Local agent run logs and workspace data: kept locally, never uploaded. ---
.agent-runs/
.workbuddy/

# --- Engineering assurance reports: contain source-trace identifiers, kept locally. ---
deliverables/

# --- Misc local cruft ---
web/
.zcode/
.DS_Store
